          "modelAnswers": [
            "I usually travel by train several times a week because I use it to go to school.",
            "I sometimes take a train on weekends when I go shopping or visit my friends.",
            "I do not travel by train very often because I usually go places by car."
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which do you prefer, traveling by train or by car? Why?",
